From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nate Isern <nate@oxy.so>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build AstroThemeService with the profile, not on first use

`AstroThemeService` is what carries the profile's Bloom colour preset into the
native colour mixer and keeps every open astro:// page in step with it. It is
a ProfileKeyedService, and its factory declares
`ServiceIsCreatedWithBrowserContext()` -- but a factory that is never
INSTANTIATED is never consulted, and a BrowserContextKeyedServiceFactory is
instantiated by exactly one place in the browser: the list this patch adds a
line to.

Without the line the declaration is inert and the service is built on first
use instead. The visible consequence is not "no theming" -- which would at
least be obvious -- but a browser that opens in the default colours and
switches to the profile's preset at some later, arbitrary moment: whenever
something first asks for the theme. That is a worse failure than none,
because it looks like a flicker bug rather than a missing registration.

The dependency lands on `//chrome/browser/profiles:profiles_extra_parts_impl`,
which is the target that actually compiles this file -- not on
`//chrome/browser:browser`, which does not, and where the edge would have left
`gn check` reporting the include as unreachable while the link happened to
work anyway. A call and the edge that makes it link are one change (061 says
the same thing); putting the edge on the wrong target is the shape that makes
that rule feel satisfied without being.

Owned by https://github.com/OxyHQ/Astro/issues/24.
---
diff --git a/chrome/browser/profiles/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/profiles/BUILD.gn
--- a/chrome/browser/profiles/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/profiles/BUILD.gn
@@ -300,6 +300,7 @@ source_set("profiles_extra_parts_impl") {
     "//chrome/browser/notifications",
     "//chrome/browser/omnibox",
     "//chrome/browser/optimization_guide",
+    "//chrome/browser/oxy:theming",
     "//chrome/browser/page_content_annotations",
     "//chrome/browser/page_content_annotations:extraction_service",
     "//chrome/browser/passage_embeddings",
diff --git a/chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc b/chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc
--- a/chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc
@@ -124,6 +124,7 @@
 #include "chrome/browser/optimization_guide/model_validator_keyed_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/optimization_guide/optimization_guide_keyed_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/origin_trials/origin_trials_factory.h"
+#include "chrome/browser/oxy/astro_theme_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/page_content_annotations/page_content_annotations_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/page_content_annotations/page_content_extraction_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/page_content_annotations/page_content_screenshot_service_factory.h"
@@ -680,6 +681,7 @@ void ChromeBrowserMainExtraPartsProfiles::
   AndroidSessionDurationsServiceFactory::GetInstance();
 #endif
   AffiliationServiceFactory::GetInstance();
+  astro::AstroThemeServiceFactory::GetInstance();
   AiDataKeyedServiceFactory::GetInstance();
   AimEligibilityServiceFactory::GetInstance();
 #if BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID)
